<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mi Princesa - Libro de Cuento</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" >
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container mt-5">
        <div class="book" id="book">
            <!-- Decoración del libro -->
            <div class="book-decoration"></div>
            
            <!-- Primera página - Portada -->
            <div class="page">
                <h1>Elizabeth, Mi Princesa <img src="./images/princesaEli.png" alt="Princesa Elizabeth" class="princess-icon" width="50" height="50" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; cursor: pointer;" onclick="showPrincessFullSequence()"></h1>
                <div class="buttons-container">
					<div class="buttons-row buttons-row-special">
						<button id="btnBirthday" class="btn btn-birthday">🎂 Feliz Cumpleaños Elizabeth</button>
						<button id="btnMomDay" class="btn btn-mom">🌸 Para una princesa muy especial</button>
					</div>
                    <div class="buttons-row buttons-row-primary">
                        <button id="btnStars" class="btn btn-stars">⭐ Nuestro planetario de amor</button>
                        <button id="btnPlayAudio" class="btn btn-danger">Cuéntame la Historia</button>
                        <button id="btnPlayAudio2" class="btn btn-info">¿Qué Significas para Mí?</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="buttons-row buttons-row-secondary">
                        <button id="btnOracula" class="btn btn-warning">🔮 Tengo nuevas predicciones, Consultame!</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-tour" id="btnTour">💙 Tour de Amor</button>
                        <!--<button id="btnEnVivo" class="btn btn-en-vivo"><span class="nota-musical" style="display: inline-block; animation: oscilarNota 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;">🎵</span> En vivo!</button>-->
                        <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XmvFviMmfro9O_tKrIUSoxdGRPNwO3LM" target="_blank" class="btn btn-download" id="btnDownload">
                            📱 Haz clic y llévame contigo
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="buttons-row buttons-row-tertiary">
                        <button id="btnVelitas" class="btn btn-velitas">🕯️ La Luz de mi Princesa</button>
                        <div class="cuponera-y-cupid-wrapper">
                            <button id="btnCuponera" class="btn btn-cuponera" style="box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 5px 15px;">💝🎫 Cuponera de Amor</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-cupid-san-valentin" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#sanValentinModal" aria-label="Feliz San Valentín" title="Feliz San Valentín"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="cupid-icon-svg" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="50" cy="26" r="11" fill="#FFFFFF"/><path d="M40 38 L60 38 L56 76 L50 86 L44 76 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/><path d="M40 38 Q8 30 18 52 Q32 48 40 38" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.95)" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M60 38 Q92 30 82 52 Q68 48 60 38" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.95)" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M32 46 Q24 55 32 64" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.95"/><line x1="26" y1="55" x2="52" y2="55" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.9"/><path d="M26 55 L20 52 L20 58 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.9"/></svg></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="d-block mt-2 text-muted">
                        🔔 <strong>Para instalar la app móvil en tu teléfono:</strong> abre este sitio desde el navegador de tu teléfono y pulsa el botón verde.  
                        Si la descargas en tu computador, transfiere el archivo a tu celular y luego instálalo allí.
                    </small>
                    
                    <!-- Videos de demostración -->
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h6 class="text-center mb-3" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.3rem;">
                            📹 Un tour privado hacia la confianza en el amor!
                        </h6>
                        <div class="videos-container">
                            <div class="video-frame">
                                <h6 class="text-center mb-2" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.1rem;">
                                    🎬 Bienvenida especial
                                </h6>
                                <div class="video-container">
                                    <video id="welcomeVideo" controls preload="none" class="w-100" style="border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(183, 28, 28, 0.2);">
                                        <source src="video/welcome.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                                        Tu navegador no soporta la reproducción de video.
                                    </video>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Timeline de SkyStart - Primera imagen clickeable -->
                            <div class="video-frame skystart-timeline-frame">
                                <h6 class="text-center mb-2" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.1rem;">
                                    🌅 Amaneceres de Cielo
                                </h6>
                                <div class="timeline-preview-container" id="skyStartPreview">
                                    <img src="images/skyStart/IMG_0585.jpg" alt="Amaneceres de Cielo" class="timeline-preview-image" style="cursor: pointer; width: 100%; height: 300px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(183, 28, 28, 0.2); transition: transform 0.3s ease;">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Timeline de StartMoon - Primera imagen clickeable -->
                            <div class="video-frame startmoon-timeline-frame">
                                <h6 class="text-center mb-2" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.1rem;">
                                    🌙 Noches de Luna
                                </h6>
                                <div class="timeline-preview-container" id="startMoonPreview">
                                    <img src="images/startMoon/IMG_0658.jpg" alt="Noches de Luna" class="timeline-preview-image" style="cursor: pointer; width: 100%; height: 300px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(183, 28, 28, 0.2); transition: transform 0.3s ease;">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="video-frame">
                                <h6 class="text-center mb-2" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; font-size: 1.1rem;">
                                    💙 Tour de amor
                                </h6>
                                <div class="video-container">
                                    <video controls preload="none" class="w-100" style="border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(183, 28, 28, 0.2);">
                                        <source src="video/parte1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                                        Tu navegador no soporta la reproducción de video.
                                    </video>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Segunda página - Contenido del libro -->
            <div class="page">
                <div class="book-layout-centered">
                    <!-- Título -->
                    <h2 style="font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;">Un Hermoso Cuento de Amor</h2>
                    <h2 style="font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">(Pulsa en las imagenes para conocer cada etapa de nuestra amor y su historia)</h2>

                    <!-- Galería de imágenes en cuadrícula centrada -->
                    <div class="gallery-container-centered">
                        <div class="gallery-grid" id="galleryGrid">
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="0" data-image="images/1.png">
                                <img src="images/1.png" alt="Imagen 1" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="1" data-image="images/2.png">
                                <img src="images/2.png" alt="Imagen 2" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="2" data-image="images/3.png">
                                <img src="images/3.png" alt="Imagen 3" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="3" data-image="images/4.png">
                                <img src="images/4.png" alt="Imagen 4" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="4" data-image="images/5.jpeg">
                                <img src="images/5.jpeg" alt="Imagen 5" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="5" data-image="images/6.jpeg">
                                <img src="images/6.jpeg" alt="Imagen 6" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="6" data-image="images/7.jpeg">
                                <img src="images/7.jpeg" alt="Imagen 7" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="7" data-image="images/8.png">
                                <img src="images/8.png" alt="Imagen 8" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="8" data-image="images/9.jpeg">
                                <img src="images/9.jpeg" alt="Imagen 9" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="9" data-image="images/10.png">
                                <img src="images/10.png" alt="Imagen 10" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="10" data-image="images/11.png">
                                <img src="images/11.png" alt="Imagen 11" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="11" data-image="images/12.png">
                                <img src="images/12.png" alt="Imagen 12" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="gallery-item" data-index="12" data-image="images/13.png">
                                <img src="images/13.png" alt="Imagen 13" class="gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
                                <div class="gallery-overlay">
                                    <span class="gallery-icon">👁️</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Texto descriptivo -->
                    <div id="our_space" style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
                        <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-color); text-align: justify; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                            Cada página de este libro contiene una parte especial de nuestra historia, 
                            cada imagen es un momento especial que hemos compartido. 
                            una historia de amor auténtica, transparente y sincera...
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
	
	<div id="sfc5lkx7b2lcq5jpe6p2arfzyyt1nhqwtp4"></div>
	<script type="text/javascript" src="https://counter5.optistats.ovh/private/counter.js?c=5lkx7b2lcq5jpe6p2arfzyyt1nhqwtp4&down=async" async></script>
	<script>
	  // Espera a que la página y el contador estén completamente cargados
	  window.addEventListener("load", function () {
		// Selecciona el div generado por el script del contador
		const contadorDiv = document.querySelector('div[id^="FCS_"][id$="_divCou"]');
		if (contadorDiv) {
		  const enlace = contadorDiv.querySelector("a");
		  if (enlace) {
			// Clona el contenido del <a> (la imagen)
			const img = enlace.querySelector("img");
			if (img) {
			  const imgClone = img.cloneNode(true);
			  // Reemplaza el <a> por solo la <img>
			  enlace.replaceWith(imgClone);
			}
		  }
		}
	  });
	</script>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@popperjs/core@2.11.6/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <!-- EmailJS removido para evitar errores 400 -->
    <script src="js/contenido.js"></script>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            // Verificar todas las imágenes de la galería
            const galleryImages = document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-item img');
            
            galleryImages.forEach((img, index) => {
                // Verificar si la imagen se carga correctamente
                img.addEventListener('load', function() {
                });
                
                img.addEventListener('error', function() {
                });
            });
        });
    </script>
    <audio id="audio-cuento" src="audio/miPrincesa.mp3" preload="none"></audio>
    <audio id="audio-pienso" src="audio/miPersonaFavorita.mp3" preload="none"></audio>
    <audio id="audio-tePienso" src="audio/tePienso.mp3" preload="none"></audio>
    

    <!-- Modal del Orácula -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="oraculaModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="oraculaModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="oraculaModalLabel">🔮 Oráculo de la Princesa</h5>
                    <div class="audio-indicator" id="audioIndicator" style="cursor: pointer;">
                        <span class="music-note" id="musicNote">🎵</span>
                        <span class="audio-text" id="audioText">Música del Oráculo</span>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div class="chat-container">
                        <div class="chat-messages" id="chatMessages">
                            <!-- Los mensajes del chat se mostrarán aquí -->
                        </div>
                        <div class="chat-input-container">
                            <div class="chat-questions" id="chatQuestions">
                                <!-- Las preguntas programadas se mostrarán aquí -->
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal de Princess - Se abre automáticamente -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="princessModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="princessModalLabel" aria-hidden="true" data-bs-backdrop="static" data-bs-keyboard="false">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content princess-modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header princess-modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="princessModalLabel">👑 Mi Princesa Especial</h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">X</button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body princess-modal-body">
                    <div class="princess-subtitle">
                        <p>Eres la luz que ilumina mi mundo, la estrella más brillante en mi cielo. Cada momento contigo es un tesoro que guardo en mi corazón.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="princess-carousel-container">
                        <div id="princessCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="false" data-bs-interval="4000">
                            <div class="carousel-inner">
                                <div class="carousel-item active">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p1.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 1">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p2.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 2">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p3.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 3">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p4.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 4">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p5.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 5">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p6.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 6">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/princess/p7.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Mi Princesa 7">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Controles del carrusel -->
                            <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
                                <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">Anterior</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
                                <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">Siguiente</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Indicadores del carrusel -->
                        <div class="carousel-indicators princess-indicators">
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Princesa 1"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Princesa 2"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Princesa 3"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="3" aria-label="Princesa 4"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="4" aria-label="Princesa 5"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="5" aria-label="Princesa 6"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#princessCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="6" aria-label="Princesa 7"></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="princess-description">
                        <p>Eres la razón por la que cada día es especial. Tu sonrisa es mi sol, tu mirada mi refugio. Eres mi princesa, mi todo, mi eternidad.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal de Estrellas -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="starsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="starsModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl">
            <div class="modal-content stars-modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header stars-modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="starsModalLabel">⭐ Coleccionando el Universo para Ti</h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body stars-modal-body">
                    <div class="stars-subtitle">
                        <p>Cada estrella que recolecto, cada constelación que descubro, es un regalo que preparo para ti, mi princesa del universo.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="stars-carousel-container">
                        <div id="starsCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
                            <div class="carousel-inner">
                                <div class="carousel-item active">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/8.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 6">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/9.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 5">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/10.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 1">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/11.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 2">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/12.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 3">
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-item">
                                    <img data-src="images/night/13.jpeg" src="" class="d-block w-100" alt="Estrella 4">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Controles del carrusel -->
                            <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
                                <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">Anterior</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
                                <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">Siguiente</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Indicadores del carrusel -->
                        <div class="carousel-indicators stars-indicators">
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Estrella 1"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Estrella 2"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Estrella 3"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="3" aria-label="Estrella 4"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="4" aria-label="Estrella 5"></button>
                            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#starsCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="4" aria-label="Estrella 6"></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="stars-description">
                        <p>Princesa, estas estrellas que recolecto son solo el comienzo. Cada una representa un deseo y un sueño. El universo es infinito, asi como capturaba la luna cada noche, sigo recolectando las estrellas para ti.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

  

    <!-- Modal de Galería - Imagen Ampliada con Texto -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="galleryModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="galleryModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content gallery-modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header gallery-modal-header">
